WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Open the sample project and choose Stripboard.

2
00:00:10.036 --> 00:00:19.036
The left column holds scenes that are not yet scheduled.

3
00:00:20.106 --> 00:00:29.106
Choose an unscheduled scene and press Enter to add it to the board.

4
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:39.120
The board groups scene strips by shooting day.

5
00:00:40.146 --> 00:00:49.146
Add a day break to divide the schedule.

6
00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:59.175
Calendar displays the schedule once a start date is set.

7
00:01:00.206 --> 00:01:09.206
DOOD summarizes cast and element days across the board.
